choose-if: (left_c >= 50 and spd_coleader_3_faction == "left") or (left_c >= labor_c and (left_c+labor_c) >= 50 and spd_coleader_3_faction == "left") or (left_c < 50 and labor_c < 50 and (reformist_c+neorevisionist_c) < 50 and spd_coleader_3_faction == "center") or (labor_c >= 50) or (labor_c >= left_c and (labor_c+left_c) >= 50 and spd_coleader_3_faction == "labor") or (labor_c >= reformist_c and labor_c >= neorevisionist_c and (labor_c+reformist_c+neorevisionist_c) >= 50 and spd_coleader_3_faction == "labor") or (labor_c >= center_c and (labor_c+center_c) >= 50 and spd_coleader_3_faction == "labor") or (reformist_c >= 50 and spd_coleader_3_faction == "reformist") or (reformist_c >= neorevisionist_c and (reformist_c+neorevisionist_c) >= 50 and spd_coleader_3_faction == "reformist") or (reformist_c >= neorevisionist_c and reformist_c >= labor_c and (labor_c+reformist_c+neorevisionist_c) >= 50 and spd_coleader_3_faction == "reformist") or (neorevisionist_c >= 50) or (neorevisionist_c >= reformist_c and (reformist_c+neorevisionist_c) >= 50 and spd_coleader_3_faction == "neorevisionist") or (neorevisionist_c >= reformist_c and neorevisionist_c >= labor_c and (labor_c+reformist_c+neorevisionist_c) >= 50 and spd_coleader_3_faction == "neorevisionist") or (left_c < 50 and labor_c < 50 and (reformist_c+neorevisionist_c) < 50 and spd_coleader_3_faction == "non-factional")

The incumbent, [+ spd_coleader_3_fullname +], wins in a victory for the [+ spd_coleader_3_faction +] faction!

- @root: The conference is concluded.

@left_3
view-if: spd_coleader_3_faction != "left"
choose-if: (left_c >= 50) or (left_c >= labor_c and (left_c+labor_c) >= 50) or (left_leader == "Baade") or (left_leader == "Hirschfeld") or (left_leader == "Radbruch") or (left_leader == "Stampfer")
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.left_leader == "Crispien") {
    Q.spd_coleader_3 = "Crispien";
